Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.14,0:00:03.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.39,0:00:04.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shake hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.52,0:00:06.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bang!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.62,0:00:09.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to play dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.44,0:00:10.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.74,0:00:12.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do like this, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.32,0:00:14.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Count me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.87,0:00:16.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a dog, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:18.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was once human.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.62,0:00:20.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you're a dog now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.66,0:00:21.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Supper is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.19,0:00:27.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.42,0:00:34.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! That's Nozomi's!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.20,0:00:38.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gen, you're a dummy, so you\Nbrought the same order as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.56,0:00:43.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nozomi...\NWhy didn't she come with us, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.14,0:00:44.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.13,0:00:46.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe she's in a spat\Nwith a certain somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.72,0:00:55.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, tell us a funny story.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.04,0:00:57.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not something a dog can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.85,0:00:59.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Meanie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.32,0:01:01.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, tell us\Nwhy you turned into a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.52,0:01:04.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did I turn into a dog...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.87,0:01:06.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, why did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:08.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Did you forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.16,0:01:12.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it happened a really long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.19,0:01:15.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then just tell us whatever\Nyou do remember, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.74,0:01:19.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What I remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.82,0:01:25.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right. It was a very long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.11,0:01:26.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Five thousand years ago now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.82,0:01:35.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Back then, I was a terribly\Nill-natured young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.57,0:01:43.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But there was someone who was\Nnice enough to give me her smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.67,0:01:50.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She possessed a special power.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.57,0:01:58.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was the power to direct all things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.82,0:02:01.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll be okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.83,0:02:05.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was the hope of all the others,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.79,0:02:09.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and the one they all trusted\Nto make their choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.33,0:02:12.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was our whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.95,0:02:18.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, our time of\Nhappiness did not last long.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.68,0:02:26.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An epidemic hit us out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.09,0:02:28.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lesions became tumors,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.56,0:02:31.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and they swelled ever\Nlarger on a daily basis.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.19,0:02:39.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And even with her power to direct\Nall things, she could not heal us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.49,0:02:42.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yamabiko...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.82,0:02:46.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do I look?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.00,0:02:47.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be honest with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.67,0:02:52.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your hair looks so clear,\Nand reminds me of snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.12,0:02:53.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.94,0:02:54.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Also...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.78,0:02:58.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,your lips are as blue as the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.43,0:02:59.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.04,0:03:01.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.01,0:03:05.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...project even more\Nkindness than they did before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.45,0:03:10.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't avert your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.57,0:03:11.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.76,0:03:15.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please. I want to get a closer look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.02,0:03:21.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmm, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.67,0:03:24.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're much\Nnicer than before. More natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.72,0:03:26.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the real me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.21,0:03:32.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But no one else would ever think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.42,0:03:49.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...\N...would have been willing\Nto do anything for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.75,0:03:53.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I would have been anything for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.47,0:03:59.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.61,0:04:03.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She never gave up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.38,0:04:08.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She fought the epidemic,\Nbelieving that she could save us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.22,0:04:14.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As the days wore on, I got so\NI could no longer look at her directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.12,0:04:16.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because it was too painful?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.02,0:04:17.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, just the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.05,0:04:22.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was far too brilliant for me\Nto look directly at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.43,0:04:24.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ooh, listen to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.60,0:04:30.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was a terrible disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.19,0:04:34.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Over time, the tumors\Nspread all over their bodies,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.72,0:04:36.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and they no longer even looked human.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.16,0:04:39.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Until finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.15,0:04:41.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.42,0:04:43.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.51,0:04:44.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.01,0:04:46.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want you to hear this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.77,0:04:51.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, there was still some\Nhope left within all of their hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.42,0:04:55.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They believed for certain that\Nshe would find a way to save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.79,0:04:58.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It sounds like she was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.36,0:04:59.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.76,0:05:06.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've seen many worlds,\Nbut she was the first person\NI ever saw with that kind of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.48,0:05:13.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Up until I met her, I was just\Nwandering aimlessly across worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.12,0:05:18.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doing so was a lot easier on me\Nthan being with my classmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.89,0:05:26.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I spent my days in\Nneither sadness nor joy,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.67,0:05:28.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and just went on living.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.63,0:05:43.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It happened one night\Nwhen there was a new moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.72,0:05:54.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's when I met her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.99,0:06:04.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell me your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.64,0:06:07.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yamabiko...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.35,0:06:09.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Kodama.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.47,0:06:26.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kodama was able to control\Neverything here, any way she liked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.48,0:06:32.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The others called her power "M," and\Nvenerated her as though she were a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.12,0:06:53.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For goodness' sake,\Nwhat am I going to do with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.79,0:06:58.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter how much time passes,\Nyou're still so needy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.38,0:07:03.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And don't come back here again, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.82,0:07:07.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.02,0:07:10.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you sleep well in a bed\Nafter all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.97,0:07:12.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.15,0:07:15.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell me, do you have\Nsome kind of power, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.04,0:07:18.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm... just a regular homeless guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.34,0:07:21.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A traveler, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.02,0:07:22.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.02,0:07:23.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't have a place\Nof my own, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.07,0:07:28.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've traveled around to different\Nplaces before coming here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.44,0:07:32.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then we finally found this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.55,0:07:35.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a very peaceful, easy world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.97,0:07:37.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Almost unbelievably so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.51,0:07:39.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.52,0:07:43.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, how come you're all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.12,0:07:45.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't drift here by yourself, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.57,0:07:46.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it you're after?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.87,0:07:47.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.55,0:07:52.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't have anything of value. Nor do I\Nhave a power that will be useful to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.66,0:07:55.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't have anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.43,0:07:57.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then tell me something—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.81,0:08:02.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to hear about\Nthe worlds you've been to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.20,0:08:06.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There isn't much to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.80,0:08:08.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anything is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.57,0:08:11.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if it's complete and utter nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.07,0:08:13.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're all dying for new information.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.42,0:08:17.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, so, tell us all\Nabout it after supper, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.72,0:08:19.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, you can't just dictate...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.35,0:08:23.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a little early still,\Nbut let's make it nighttime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.84,0:08:25.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One with a full moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.97,0:08:29.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.05,0:08:30.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.54,0:08:38.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Guys, it's suppertime!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.57,0:08:41.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Treat me like a fool, will she...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.88,0:08:46.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To me, her kindness felt only disturbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.20,0:08:52.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those guys all seem so fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.38,0:08:59.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,625)}And it's not as though\Nany of them believed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.08,0:09:08.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.54,0:09:11.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wha—?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.70,0:09:14.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It doesn't taste as good cold, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.54,0:09:17.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here, while it's still hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.97,0:09:22.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.02,0:09:23.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, help yourself—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.02,0:09:24.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I said no thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.96,0:09:30.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.52,0:09:32.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.70,0:09:38.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn it, damn it, damn it! And damn her!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.89,0:09:49.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.89,0:09:53.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get it now. Your tongue\Nburns easily, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:55.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.02,0:09:57.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mmm, just right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.22,0:09:58.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here, try some.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.92,0:09:59.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.59,0:10:00.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.55,0:10:12.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.71,0:10:14.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.10,0:10:21.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Too salty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.11,0:10:27.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right. I must have\Nadded a bit too much salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.62,0:10:31.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've never had soup this\Nsalty before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.22,0:10:32.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.99,0:10:35.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, I'll be more careful next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.53,0:10:39.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was so embarrassed\Nand frustrated by myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.04,0:10:42.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...but also a little bit happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.09,0:10:46.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a surprisingly simple fellow, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.46,0:10:52.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, I think I can relate a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.82,0:10:52.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just a little bit, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.45,0:10:58.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have even tried. I failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.17,0:10:59.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.17,0:11:03.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. All I ever do is regret\Nthe things I've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.17,0:11:06.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've wasted most of my life doing so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.22,0:11:09.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then I regret having done {\i1}that{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.12,0:11:12.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incredible. You must be\Na master at regretting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.32,0:11:14.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you ever have any regrets?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.92,0:11:18.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like, say, having drifted into this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.57,0:11:19.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.92,0:11:21.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.92,0:11:24.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I was never given\Nthe freedom to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.85,0:11:29.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I went to school like normal,\Nand attended my classes like normal...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.60,0:11:31.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and before I knew it, here I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.48,0:11:35.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's nothing there to regret\Neven if I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.82,0:11:36.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.71,0:11:42.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You see, all we can do is move forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.32,0:11:53.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I began thinking that this might be\Nthe final destination of my long journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.38,0:11:56.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought those days would\Nkeep going on forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.54,0:12:01.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They'd go on forever, I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.82,0:12:05.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How long has he been here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.77,0:12:08.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You found him because\Na bird was making noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.02,0:12:09.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, is this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.86,0:12:18.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell me your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.57,0:12:35.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You... are so ugly...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.56,0:12:45.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are lots of rumors going around,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.67,0:12:48.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,wondering if that man\Nis the cause of this plague.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.52,0:12:51.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He probably is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.67,0:12:53.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So what are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.97,0:12:58.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to abandon him,\Nif I can help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.72,0:13:04.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He told me that I was ugly after\Nhe looked at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.37,0:13:05.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He didn't even hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.87,0:13:08.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He was nice enough to speak the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.70,0:13:15.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, if I can find out\Nwhat's causing these tumors,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.87,0:13:15.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think I can do something\Nabout them using my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.07,0:13:17.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.97,0:13:20.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think I should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.97,0:13:23.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.80,0:13:29.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...think that your idea is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.46,0:13:33.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really? Is that really what you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.32,0:13:37.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course. You're always right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.77,0:13:38.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.83,0:13:45.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not as great a person as all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.52,0:13:50.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's kind of like you were...\Nwhen you had just barely arrived here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.65,0:13:56.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I looked the other way...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.54,0:13:58.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...from her mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.91,0:14:04.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I should have corrected\Nher choice at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.61,0:14:07.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.57,0:14:08.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.39,0:14:10.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was probably...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.07,0:14:12.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...because I believed in her...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.21,0:14:16.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...more than I believed in myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.50,0:14:22.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.42,0:14:24.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come and let me check you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.43,0:14:27.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You said the same thing yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.82,0:14:28.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.13,0:14:34.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's turned into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.14,0:14:39.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You just barely told him\Nthat he was all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.57,0:14:41.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me have a look. There's still—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.13,0:14:42.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't touch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.72,0:14:44.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If only {\i1}he {\i0}wasn't here...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.65,0:14:47.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's the one who\Nbrought this illness here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.72,0:14:49.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we had only killed him back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.63,0:15:01.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I said that you were ugly,\Nbut that was a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.55,0:15:05.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The truth is, I thought\Nyou were beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.42,0:15:07.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did you lie, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.77,0:15:09.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanted to be liked by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.97,0:15:12.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And,\Njust as I expected, you were pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.62,0:15:14.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you take people's feelings for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.62,0:15:17.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get that question a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.92,0:15:20.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the cause of\Nthese tumors, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.87,0:15:22.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.95,0:15:25.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who brought them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.34,0:15:29.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then I need you to tell me\Nhow to conquer them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.22,0:15:31.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I should be able to cure these tumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.47,0:15:34.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those wounds can't be healed by anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.41,0:15:38.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know you must understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.82,0:15:40.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that I'm not all that's causing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.68,0:15:44.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never mind. I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.98,0:15:46.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.74,0:15:48.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.15,0:15:51.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll give you this! Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.97,0:15:55.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.97,0:15:57.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pretty, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.37,0:16:00.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is an award\Nyou get for killing a hundred people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.50,0:16:04.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This one is for a thousand.\NThis one is for ten thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.97,0:16:06.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See? Pretty, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.02,0:16:09.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.72,0:16:12.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. This always happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.82,0:16:15.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't help but do the wrong thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.02,0:16:17.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then finally, people end up hating me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.72,0:16:20.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I'm supposed to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.90,0:16:23.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't come near us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.47,0:16:25.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, please, don't be so afraid of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.16,0:16:27.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get out of our sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.17,0:16:35.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn it! How come this...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.08,0:16:38.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...always happens to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.12,0:16:41.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yamabiko, you didn't fall ill?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.03,0:16:46.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. And I hated that more than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.21,0:16:52.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He said that it wasn't the plague that he\Nbrought, but a different "{\i1}This {\i0}World."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.02,0:16:56.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A world where mental wounds\Nmanifested as tumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.52,0:17:00.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He called that world "Scar Art."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.92,0:17:04.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is my art.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.22,0:17:06.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm hoping\Nto collect many more of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.32,0:17:10.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here, you can touch it. Come closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.85,0:17:16.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't you want to know why\Nyou're the only one who hasn't taken ill?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.73,0:17:19.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.62,0:17:24.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's because\N{\i1}This {\i0}World is a world that you made.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.10,0:17:28.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hadn't realized it until he said so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.69,0:17:32.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The power to materialize\Nwhat was within my mind—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.56,0:17:42.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that's what my power was.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.14,0:17:47.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At some point along the way, I had\Nbecome locked up inside my own shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.97,0:17:51.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the reason why I alone\Ndidn't suffer from the illness,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.47,0:17:55.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and why, within those parameters,\NKodama's powers were meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.18,0:18:01.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whatever is causing the wounds themselves\Nare events happening somewhere\Noutside of {\i1}This {\i0}World.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.72,0:18:05.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You all had to resolve those.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.17,0:18:06.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then how do we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.71,0:18:09.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You just had to change yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.07,0:18:13.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All you had to do was break\Nout of your shell and fly out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.17,0:18:16.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it's too late now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.57,0:18:18.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.22,0:18:28.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get it.\NI know what you're trying to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.72,0:18:32.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But there's nothing that those of us\Nwho have been discarded can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.67,0:18:34.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.92,0:18:37.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've heard\Nthe voice, too, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.15,0:18:39.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who exactly are you, anyway?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.37,0:18:41.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.97,0:18:44.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've met before, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.87,0:18:46.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know you've seen me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.87,0:18:51.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In all sorts of places.\NAnd not just once, either; many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.15,0:18:55.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There, there, good boy, good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.16,0:18:58.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If only you had a little more courage,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.78,0:19:02.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you could have saved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.82,0:19:05.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.52,0:19:09.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So eerily nice, but surprisingly dull—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.77,0:19:13.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,this world is you to a tee.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.72,0:19:14.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well then, farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.96,0:19:17.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.56,0:19:19.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I never mentioned, did I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.64,0:19:22.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...that my name was War?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.71,0:19:27.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And after I kept\Ntelling him to fly away...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.08,0:19:29.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did a bad thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.77,0:19:36.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't helped him, he could have\Nflown off to a faraway world somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.73,0:19:43.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought I was helping him, when\Nactually, I was hampering him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.17,0:19:45.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yamabiko...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.57,0:19:46.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.32,0:19:49.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will you do anything I ask you to?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.77,0:19:50.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.37,0:19:55.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then, someday, fulfill\Nthe promise you made to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.87,0:19:58.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have to fly away from this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.15,0:20:01.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is not the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.82,0:20:06.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.33,0:20:12.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell me, you'll do that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.17,0:20:14.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know you're able to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.89,0:20:18.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all, you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.82,0:20:30.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And so, a single dog was all\Nthat remained in the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.68,0:20:35.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.15,0:20:38.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had plenty of chances—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.14,0:20:41.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,chances to save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.14,0:20:45.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I closed my eyes to all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.42,0:20:52.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Her wish was to walk together with me\Nin the outside world, that was all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.75,0:20:56.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She waited for me all that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.87,0:21:00.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And yet I was unable\Nto step up and respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.99,0:21:04.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry to talk your ears off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.61,0:21:07.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yamabiko...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.11,0:21:08.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.44,0:21:09.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I sleep together with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.03,0:21:20.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1043)}Remember, you promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.94,0:21:25.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's walk together
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.77,0:21:30.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,down that road made of\Nskeleton bones you once told me about,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.22,0:21:32.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,while we have some ice cream or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.92,0:21:33.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.02,0:21:36.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.90,0:21:50.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.94,0:21:53.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-mm. I have a lot on my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.69,0:21:58.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like, "Why did I do what I did back then?"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.32,0:22:00.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and "Why didn't I do {\i1}that{\i0}?"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.57,0:22:04.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After thinking about all those things\Nthat I can't do anything about now,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.52,0:22:05.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm no longer sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.77,0:22:10.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to accept the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.09,0:22:13.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was so afraid of losing the light
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.71,0:22:15.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that I ended up not\Nbeing able to step forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.71,0:22:19.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I was finally able to take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.47,0:22:27.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It took me 5,000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.76,0:22:31.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I can do it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.94,0:22:32.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.35,0:22:34.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.65,0:22:43.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Nozomi! Long time!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.07,0:22:45.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're late!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.72,0:22:48.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is exactly the time we agreed on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.57,0:22:52.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?! I've been waiting two weeks since\Nthe day we were supposed to meet!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.54,0:22:55.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Our clocks are different.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.80,0:22:57.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.77,0:23:01.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The flow of time must have\Nbeen different for the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.01,0:23:05.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There, back in sync.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.72,0:23:07.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.71,0:23:13.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, so all that happened on the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.47,0:23:17.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But who was this\N"War" guy fighting against?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.92,0:23:19.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,His objective was to kill God.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.73,0:23:22.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.76,0:23:23.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.12,0:23:26.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if he were able to kill him...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.49,0:23:28.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if that would change anything.
